      "zh": "尚未确认左转穿过下一门洞进入卧室，也未确认电视和梳妆台在左、床在右以及窗前停止点。",
      "en": "It has not been confirmed that the robot turned left through the next doorway into the bedroom, nor that the TV and dresser are on the left, the bed is on the right, and the stopping point by the window has been reached."
    }
  ]
}
